{"conversation_hash": "1ec4793d6f414e1477d57f6534e9862a", "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo-0301", "timestamp": "2023-04-11 08:20:59+00:00", "conversation": [{"content": "Probe Response  Tag: Extended Supported Rates SAE Hash to Element Only", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8d619051bb5fb420a8f62522d6945f67be26f69162552c6db09e0f78a2a71a7b", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/101.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 119957}, {"content": "A Probe Response frame is a Wi-Fi management frame that is sent by an access point to a Wi-Fi client device in response to a Probe Request frame. The Probe Response frame contains information about the access point, such as its name (SSID), security settings, and supported data rates.\n\nThe Extended Supported Rates tag in the Probe Response frame is used to indicate to the client device the additional data rates that the access point supports beyond the basic mandatory rates. These extended rates may not be supported by all client devices, so the access point will only include those rates that are supported by the client device that sent the Probe Request.\n\nThe SAE Hash to Element Only field in the Probe Response frame is used to provide secure authentication between the client device and the access point using the Simultaneous Authentication of Equals (SAE) protocol. The SAE protocol is used to establish a shared secret key between the client device and access point, which is used to encrypt data transmissions over the Wi-Fi network.\n\nThe SAE Hash to Element Only field only includes a hashed version of the SAE information element, which helps to reduce the size of the Probe Response frame and reduce network overhead. This field is only included in Probe Response frames when the access point supports the SAE protocol and the client device requests it in the Probe Request frame.", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-11 07:43:58+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 119957}, {"content": "该Tag是有什么作用", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8d619051bb5fb420a8f62522d6945f67be26f69162552c6db09e0f78a2a71a7b", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/101.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120016}, {"content": "这个Tag指的是Wi-Fi Probe Response帧中的Extended Supported Rates字段，它用于提供关于接入点支持的额外数据传输速率的信息给客户端设备。这个Tag传递了接入点支持的额外速率（不包括基本的必需速率），这些速率不是所有的客户端设备都支持的。接入点只会在响应中包含客户端设备所支持的速率。这个信息对于客户端设备选择最适合它们的接入点非常重要。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-11 07:54:00+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120016}, {"content": "如果Wi-Fi Probe Response帧中不包含Extended Supported Rates字段有什么影响", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8d619051bb5fb420a8f62522d6945f67be26f69162552c6db09e0f78a2a71a7b", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/101.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120034}, {"content": "如果Wi-Fi Probe Response帧中不包含Extended Supported Rates字段，则客户端设备可能无法知道接入点所支持的额外数据传输速率，这可能会导致客户端设备连接不上最佳的接入点。当客户端设备不知道接入点支持哪些速率时，连接可能会更慢或不够可靠，这可能会降低Wi-Fi网络的性能。此外，客户端设备可能无法使用接入点所支持的最高速率，这可能会影响其在网络上的用途。因此，包含Extended Supported Rates字段是非常重要的，以确保客户端设备可以获得最佳的Wi-Fi体验。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-11 07:56:03+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120034}, {"content": "不包含Extended Supported Rates字段会造成sta连不上设备吗", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8d619051bb5fb420a8f62522d6945f67be26f69162552c6db09e0f78a2a71a7b", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/101.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120051}, {"content": "不一定会导致STA无法连接到设备，但是如果Wi-Fi Probe Response帧中不包含Extended Supported Rates字段，则STA无法知道设备支持的额外的数据传输速率。这可能会导致STA连接设备时选择不够优化的速率，从而影响性能和稳定性。此外，如果STA支持的速率不包含设备支持的额外速率，则可能无法连接到设备。因此，为了确保STA可以获得最佳的Wi-Fi连接体验，设备应包含Extended Supported Rates字段在其Wi-Fi Probe Response帧中。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-11 07:57:32+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120051}, {"content": "那么如何添加Extended Supported Rates字段", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8d619051bb5fb420a8f62522d6945f67be26f69162552c6db09e0f78a2a71a7b", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/101.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120056}, {"content": "要在Wi-Fi Probe Response帧中添加Extended Supported Rates字段，设备需要在信标帧和Probe Response帧中分别设置支持的基本速率和额外速率。然后，在Probe Response帧中添加Extended Supported Rates信息元素，其中包含设备支持的所有额外速率。\n\nExtended Supported Rates信息元素是一个二进制字节序列，包含每个额外速率的值。每个速率的值是一个字节，其位表示速率值。设备需要根据所支持的额外速率指定相应的位。如下面是Extended Supported Rates信息元素的格式:\n\n```\n  ------------------------------------------------\n  | Element ID | Length | Supported rates (bytes) |\n  ------------------------------------------------\n```\n\n- Element ID：用于标识信息元素类型。Extended Supported Rates信息元素的ID为50。\n- Length：用于指定信息元素的长度。\n- Supported rates (bytes)：指定设备支持的速率的值。每个速率用一个字节表示。例如，一个速率为24 Mbps的设备值为0x06，因为24以1Mbps单位表示，即0x06在二进制中表示为00000110。\n\n设备需要根据其支持的额外速率指定Supported Rates字段中的每个速率值，然后将其添加到Probe Response帧中的Extended Supported Rates字段中。客户端设备在接收到该信息元素后，可以使用这些额外速率来选择与设备的最佳连接。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-11 07:58:20+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120056}, {"content": "RSN Capabilities：0x00cc", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8d619051bb5fb420a8f62522d6945f67be26f69162552c6db09e0f78a2a71a7b", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/101.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120100}, {"content": "RSN Capabilities是Wi-Fi网络中使用的一个信息元素，包含用于描述网络安全和加密性的各种参数。每个信息元素都有一个特定的值来标识它们。而0x00cc标识的是RSN Capabilities信息元素中的加密套件参数。\n\n在RSN Capabilities信息元素中，加密套件是用16位的数值表示的。0x00cc表示选择了两种加密套件，CCMP和TKIP。CCMP是一种更强大的加密协议，比TKIP更安全，但需要更高的计算能力。如果客户端设备和访问点都支持CCMP，则应该使用它来加密数据传输。否则，如果其中一方只支持TKIP，则应该使用TKIP来保护数据传输。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-11 08:02:40+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120100}, {"content": "RSN Capabilities：0x00c0", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8d619051bb5fb420a8f62522d6945f67be26f69162552c6db09e0f78a2a71a7b", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/101.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120116}, {"content": "RSN Capabilities是Wi-Fi网络中使用的一个信息元素，包含用于描述网络安全和加密性的各种参数。每个信息元素都有一个特定的值来标识它们。而0x00c0标识的是RSN Capabilities信息元素中的认证和密钥管理套件参数。\n\n在RSN Capabilities信息元素中，认证和密钥管理套件也是用16位的数值表示的。0x00c0表示选择了两种套件，即802.1X和Pre-Shared Key (PSK)。 \n\n802.1X是一种认证协议，用于验证客户端设备的身份，并为其分配一个加密密钥。使用802.1X需要额外的身份验证服务器，并需要客户端设备支持802.1X认证。\n\nPSK是另一种认证方法，可以使用一个预先共享的密钥来验证客户端设备，并派生一个加密密钥。PSK不需要额外的认证服务器，但其密钥必须是预先共享的，并在客户端设备和访问点之间共享。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-11 08:04:25+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120116}, {"content": "Wi-Fi Probe Response中的RSN Infarmation", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8d619051bb5fb420a8f62522d6945f67be26f69162552c6db09e0f78a2a71a7b", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/101.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120236}, {"content": "Wi-Fi Probe Response中的RSN Information字段是用于提供与安全相关的信息元素，并指示Wi-Fi网络中正在使用的加密和认证协议。RSN Information字段包含了许多子字段，每个子字段用于标识某种特定的安全功能。这些子字段包括：\n\n- RSN Version：表示所使用的RSN（Robust Security Network）协议版本。\n- Group Cipher Suite：表示用于保护集群流量的加密套件。\n- Pairwise Cipher Suite Count：表示用于保护单播流量的加密套件数量。\n- Pairwise Cipher Suite List：实际用于保护单播流量的加密套件列表。\n- AKM Suite Count：表示用于鉴定和密钥交换的认证和密钥管理套件数量。\n- AKM Suite List：实际用于鉴定和密钥交换的认证和密钥管理套件列表。\n\n这些信息告诉客户端设备Wi-Fi网络现在正在使用的安全参数，以便客户端设备可以相应地配置自己的安全设置并尝试加入该网络。在连接到Wi-Fi网络时，客户端设备将根据这些参数执行安全认证和加密算法来保护网络流量。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-11 08:20:59+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120236}], "turn": 8, "language": "Chinese", "openai_moderation": [{"categories": {"harassment": false, "hara