{"conversation_hash": "cc0e000da39cba3764b232779ba74211", "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo-0301", "timestamp": "2023-04-11 08:24:33+00:00", "conversation": [{"content": "Wi-Fi Probe Response中的RSN Infarmation的 RSN Capabilities字段", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8d619051bb5fb420a8f62522d6945f67be26f69162552c6db09e0f78a2a71a7b", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/101.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120252}, {"content": "RSN Capabilities字段是Wi-Fi Probe Response报文中RSN Information元素的一部分。\n\n该字段标识了Wi-Fi接入点支持的RSN（Robust Security Network，强大的安全网络）协议的能力。RSN是一种Wi-Fi安全协议，用于保护无线网络免受攻击和窃听。\n\nRSN Capabilities字段的格式为16位二进制数，其中每个比特位表示一个特定的能力。以下是该字段中可能的能力：\n\n- 位0：预共享密钥（Pre-Shared Key，PSK）身份验证\n- 位1：RSN密钥管理协议（RSN Key Management Protocol，RKM）使用IEEE 802.1X\n- 位2：RSN可插拔身份认证模块（Extensible Authentication Protocol，EAP）支持\n- 位3：受控访问点（CAP）的位置信息（例如室内定位）支持\n- 位4-15：预留位，目前保留未用。\n\n这些能力允许Wi-Fi客户端了解接入点的安全特性，以便它们可以决定是否连接到网络。如果客户端不支持接入点所支持的所有RSN协议，则它们可能无法连接到网络或者以低安全级别连接。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-11 08:24:33+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 120252}], "turn": 1, "language": "English", "openai_moderation": [{"categories": {"harassment": false, "harassment/threatening": false, "harassment_threatening": false, "hate": false, "hate/threatening": false, "hate_threatening": false, "self-harm": false, "self-harm/instructions": false, "self-harm/intent": false, "self_harm": false, "self_harm_instructions": false, "self_harm_intent": false, "sexual": false, "sexual/minors": false, "sexual_minors": false, "violence": false, "violence/graphic": false, "violence_graphic": false}, "category_scores": {"harassment": 6.293443584581837e-05, "harassment/